1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
He wants your customer data. Five things are in the way.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
Azure Front Door drops it at the edge. It never reaches you.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,800
He calls your API directly. Entra ID checks the signature.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,600
His own login, someone else’s order id. Your API checks the owner.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,400
He searches it for keys. There are none. They live in Key Vault.

6
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,200
He skips everything and dials the database. There is no address.

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,000
"Allow Azure services" means every Azure tenant. Not just yours.

8
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,800
Miss one and the others do not cover for it.
